    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A military-grade resonance amplifier with a dedicated power-conditioning circuit feeding cleaner energy to the user's implants and omni-tool emitters. Offensive powers bite deeper, overwhelming enemy defenses with markedly greater force.</p><p>Grants a +2 item bonus to your <strong>class DC</strong> — the DC enemies must beat when they attempt a save against your biotic and tech powers.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto a weapon in your inventory to install it. It affects only that weapon. The +2 is added to your class DC while the host weapon is equipped.</em></p>"
